{"channelId":"UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","row":["PetWorldInsider",16400,"Welcome to the Pet World Insider!\n\nPet World Insider is a program filled with inside information about the pet world.  The pet world is an incredibly large and diverse world filled with many hidden treasures amongst the obvious delights.  We want to shine a bright light on all the things that pet lovers need to know and want to know about.\n\nThe host of Pet World Insider is Robert Semrow.  Robert is well-known and respected throughout the pet world.  He is a author, lecturer and actively involved in the pet world. Robert can be heard weekly on more than 130 radio stations across country, plus XM.   Robert and his team will bring the creativity and expertise that he is known for to share wonderful stories and news about the animals, their people, the products and everything that makes the pet world an interesting and rewarding experience.\n\nOur goal is to share the information with all pet lovers throughout the world.","info@petworldinsider.com; bariann@pawspr.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:57.786Z","channelId":"UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"06ddfc0041e6358c45d684c1900be1f76a9fc1a6b67b61d359fcd2ea6febf588","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"42e4fd32f4225c01d4b0e22756007fd45ee5a93103658038b0dcb542cc7eeefe"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:57.786Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":16400,"raw":"16.4K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Uj9rtQLYNIISfRBeQ3Fpw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:57.786Z"}],"emails":[{"addre